# Deny by default, then allow only what the image actually needs. An exclusion
# list silently ships whatever gets added later; this cannot.
*

# --- Build inputs -----------------------------------------------------------
!requirements.txt
!main.py
!core/
!cogs/
!resources/

# --- Re-exclude anything that slipped in under the allowed directories ------
# .env is never needed: configuration arrives as environment variables.
**/.env
**/*.env
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store

# Live state is bind-mounted at runtime and must never be baked into a layer:
# databases/ and archives/ hold member data, and an image is far easier to
# leak than a repository.
databases/
archives/
logs/
backups/
